&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Please check out the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/SpecterOps/BloodHound/wiki/Contact&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
